T	"要選 hemodialysis 還是 peritoneal dialysis？"
T	"Continuous 還是 intermittent？"
T	"首選 intermittent hemodialysis。"
T	"Intermittent hemodialysis。"
T	"另外，筆記畫個大叉。"
T	"腹膜透析，"
T	"peritoneal dialysis，"
T	"對 lithium clearance 實在太差。"
